    "body": "There are guest customers that visit the website multiple times. And it is very frustrating for them to have to close the EuCookieLaw notification more than once. \r\n\r\nNow, the Delete guests schedule task deletes the guest users, even if they have closed the EuCookieLaw notification. I think the method for deleting guest customers should check first if there is generic attribute with key EuCookieLaw.Accepted and delete the guest customer only if there isn't one. Maybe add a setting for this feature also.",
